  "post_content": "<p><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: Arial; font-size: 15px; line-height: 21.33333396911621px;\">La piscina cubierta municipal de Onda ha acogido la tarde de este jueves, un a&ntilde;o m&aacute;s, la campa&ntilde;a Banya&#39;t per l&#39;esclerosi m&uacute;ltiple, organizada por la Associaci&oacute; d&#39;Esclerosi M&uacute;ltiple de Castell&oacute; (AEMC), con la colaboraci&oacute;n&nbsp; varias instituciones empresas o entidades, como el Ayuntamiento, la Diputaci&oacute;n de Castell&oacute;n o la Caja Rural de Onda.</span></p><div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/banya039tesclerosimultiple14/img_1202.jpg\" alt=\"img_1202\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/banya039tesclerosimultiple14/img_1203.jpg\" alt=\"img_1203\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/banya039tesclerosimultiple14/img_1204.jpg\" alt=\"img_1204\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/banya039tesclerosimultiple14/img_1205.jpg\" alt=\"img_1205\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/banya039tesclerosimultiple14/img_1206.jpg\" alt=\"img_1206\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/banya039tesclerosimultiple14/img_1209.jpg\" alt=\"img_1209\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/banya039tesclerosimultiple14/img_1210.jpg\" alt=\"img_1210\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/banya039tesclerosimultiple14/img_1212.jpg\" alt=\"img_1212\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d